                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man apaje ceke mi ng’om, kadok mi kodhi mi ng’om, kadi mi nying’ yen, en e pa Yehova; en e leng’ ni Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek ng’atu moko biwaru gin moko mir apaje pare, ebimedo ng’ete mir abije i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man apaje ceke mi dhok kadi mir udul rombe, gin ceke ma tek ukadhu ther uluth, apaje bibedo leng’ ni Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiyenyo ngo tek ebedo ber kadi rac, kadok aloka de ebiloke ngo: man tek eloke moko, e en ku gin maeno m’eloke pire bilund bedo leng’; jubiware ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
